---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Slovenščina"
  description="Slovenska različica FitFamBam prihaja. English is ready today."
>
  <section class="wrap coming">
    <p class="kicker">Jezik · Language</p>
    <h1>Slovenščina <span class="accent">prihaja.</span></h1>
    <p class="lede">
      FitFamBam bo kmalu tudi v slovenščini. Danes je stran v angleščini. Hvala za potrpežljivost.
    </p>
    <p class="en">
      The Slovenian edition is on the way. English is live. Luka and Mariah write from home in Slovenia, with four children in the house.
    </p>
    <a class="btn" href="/">Back to English</a>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .coming {
    padding: var(--space-4xl) 0;
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    margin: 0.3em 0 0.5em;
  }

  .en {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin: 1.25em 0 var(--space-xl);
  }
</style>
